  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: bb50b23a4cf2d8b458c5808c80931e04, type: 3}
  m_Name: 3DAYSLEFT AAB
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Game.Dialogue.DialogueNode
  speakerName: Oryctola
  dialogueType: 2
  advanceDialogueDatabase: 1
  lines:
  - portrait:
    - {fileID: -4587358237732827174, guid: 53c612e55a1353848b4b98d67d941ce2, type: 3}
    PortraitAnimationFPS: 8
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0e68174b74dce0a49b3e1e42ef9f7ef9, type: 3}
    voiceVolume: 1
    text: ...
    typingSpeed: 1
  - portrait:
    - {fileID: 5035677201601703499, guid: 49f8dc94f1446e24b923f30caecc9884, type: 3}
    PortraitAnimationFPS: 8
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0e68174b74dce0a49b3e1e42ef9f7ef9, type: 3}
    voiceVolume: 1
    text: 'You know what? Fine! I''ll convince YOU then! '
    typingSpeed: 1
  - portrait:
    - {fileID: -4587358237732827174, guid: 53c612e55a1353848b4b98d67d941ce2, type: 3}
    PortraitAnimationFPS: 8
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0e68174b74dce0a49b3e1e42ef9f7ef9, type: 3}
    voiceVolume: 1
    text: We had it all. We were at the apex of history, we created, we innovated,
      we refined. Then a- some mysterious sort of... virus... affected our lettuce
      supply. It started growing uncontrollably. It took over everything, everywhere.
    typingSpeed: 1
  - portrait:
    - {fileID: -4587358237732827174, guid: 53c612e55a1353848b4b98d67d941ce2, type: 3}
    PortraitAnimationFPS: 8
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0e68174b74dce0a49b3e1e42ef9f7ef9, type: 3}
    voiceVolume: 1
    text: Our cities got compromised. Many starved, unable to digest this new sort
      of lettuce. The city of Sylvila was the last standing, and the Coalition of
      Syl, we... we tried many things. Fire, ice, harshness, softness, we tried...
      well, we tried you.
    typingSpeed: 1
  - portrait:
    - {fileID: -4587358237732827174, guid: 53c612e55a1353848b4b98d67d941ce2, type: 3}
    PortraitAnimationFPS: 8
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0e68174b74dce0a49b3e1e42ef9f7ef9, type: 3}
    voiceVolume: 1
    text: Alas. Too few of you, too late. We failed.
    typingSpeed: 1
  - portrait:
    - {fileID: -4587358237732827174, guid: 53c612e55a1353848b4b98d67d941ce2, type: 3}
    PortraitAnimationFPS: 8
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0e68174b74dce0a49b3e1e42ef9f7ef9, type: 3}
    voiceVolume: 1
    text: 'Hahahaha. Who knew that such a little thing as growing lettuce could spell
      the end of us. '
    typingSpeed: 1
  - portrait:
    - {fileID: -4587358237732827174, guid: 53c612e55a1353848b4b98d67d941ce2, type: 3}
    PortraitAnimationFPS: 8
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0e68174b74dce0a49b3e1e42ef9f7ef9, type: 3}
    voiceVolume: 1
    text: 'There''s nothing left to try now. The ugly green mass is indestructible
      and it will slowly push us to an excruciating extinction. '
    typingSpeed: 1
  - portrait:
    - {fileID: -4587358237732827174, guid: 53c612e55a1353848b4b98d67d941ce2, type: 3}
    PortraitAnimationFPS: 8
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0e68174b74dce0a49b3e1e42ef9f7ef9, type: 3}
    voiceVolume: 1
    text: 'There is no contentment to be found in this world any longer.

'
    typingSpeed: 1
  - portrait:
    - {fileID: -4587358237732827174, guid: 53c612e55a1353848b4b98d67d941ce2, type: 3}
    PortraitAnimationFPS: 8
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0e68174b74dce0a49b3e1e42ef9f7ef9, type: 3}
    voiceVolume: 1
    text: So... now you know. Leave now, and don't come back here. Goodbye.
    typingSpeed: 1
  ChoicePortraits: []
  ChoicePortraitAnimationFPS: 8
